<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n67224" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μέτοχος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>sharing in, partaking of</i>, c.
			gen., [
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς συμφορῆς] τὸ πλεῦν μέτοχος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					3.52
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μ. ἐλπίδων, τέχνης</span>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Ion</u>
				698
			</span></i> (lyr.), <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Phdr.</u>
				262d
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ βίου</span>, of a wife,
				<i><span class="en">
				Diod.Com.
				3.5
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δίκης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Mu.</u>
					401b29
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			Subst., <i>partner, accomplice in</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ φόνου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>HF</u>
					721
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Antipho
				3.3.11
			</span></i>: abs., <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				8.92
			</span></i>; <i>partner</i> in business, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PHib.</u>
				1.109.3
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B. C.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PCair.Zen.</u>
				176.102
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B. C.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ostr.Bodl.</u>
				i92
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				251
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii B. C.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ev.Luc.</u>
				5.7
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>member of a board</i> of officials, freq. in phrase <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ δεῖνα καὶ μέτοχοι πράκτορες, ἐπιτηρηταί,
				ἀγορανόμοι, τραπεζῖται</span>, etc., <i><span class="en">
				<u>PFlor.</u>
				358.5
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A. D.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PSI</u>
				2.160.4
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A. D.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PStrassb.</u>
				52.17
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A. D.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>POxy.</u>
				96.4
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A. D.)</span>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>joint owner</i> of a house, <i><span class="en">
				<u>CPHerm.</u>
				119
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>A</u>
				iv 20
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii A. D.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θεῶν μέτοχοι</span>, of the demigods,
				<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				640.20
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				14.2117
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Rome</span>).</div>
